9. _mu_ {d}utu {d}amar-utu u3 am-mi-s,a-du-qa2 _lugal in-pa3-de3-mesz_ 
#tr.ts: nīš šamaš marduk u ammi-ṣaduqa šarrum itmû
#tr.en: by the life of Šamaš, Marduk and king Ammi-ṣaduqa, they swore.
