#tr.ts: maḫar ...
#tr.en: before ...;
12. _igi_ <...> 
#tr.ts: maḫar ...
#tr.en: before ...;
13. _igi_ <...> 
#tr.ts: maḫar ...
#tr.en: before ...;
14. _mu i7 tu-tu-he2-gal2_
#tr.ts: šanat nāram tutu ḫengallum
